{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0163_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b92c7681275878661119c0bbdbc0252f5dc84a7da85899bcfbdda1bfd7bbcaf7", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影……\nだけど、翼の姿が見えない。どこに行ったんだろう？）", "zh": "（今天要拍写真杂志《偶像写真！！》……不过，却没看到翼的身影。她去哪儿了呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0163_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c4afbb1f566a6677f7352d740f4ccdd489620a0145e5c9d6bc0f8f683eaea1c7", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nえへへ♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0163_1002_p", "source_sha256": "767e31d5ec6deaa26a1236c802a7644ff66d721e2394cf7697e3a9f90d4abcb9", "ja": "翼、どこに行ってたんだ……って、着替えてきたのか。\nずいぶん早いんだな？", "zh": "翼，你刚才去哪儿了……等等，你已经换好衣服了啊。真快啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0163_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ee1df291818ceb9b8589e9c238b8ae4e8b5c16c97ed193dfbc035205431a85a1", "ja": "カワイイ制服だから、早く着てみたくて♪　ねえねえ\n{$P$}さん、似合ってますか？", "zh": "因为是可爱的制服，所以我想早点试穿一下♪　呐呐，{$P$}先生，适合我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0163_1004_p", "source_sha256": "3d64abb566a368e1660a8fb568f7b822b008854960e699f121c4570c1c4c4acf", "ja": "ああ、よく似合ってるよ。\nこうして見ると、やっぱり学生なんだな。", "zh": "啊，很适合你。\n这么一看，果然还是学生啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0163_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "791784862ccffd3b84b1a73a23671b0ea24ee39213c4db91d861c634d17c9125", "ja": "ありがとうございまーす！\n今日のお仕事、がんばっちゃおうっと。", "zh": "谢谢您——！\n今天的工作也要加油啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0163_1006_p", "source_sha256": "4bd7b3fe52109174939af1c9aeadef975ac6ffccf031977d5079ed844fae37d5", "ja": "なんだか、普段の学校生活が目に浮かぶな。\n翼は学校でも人気者なんじゃないか？", "zh": "总觉得平时在学校里的生活都浮现在眼前了。翼在学校里也很受欢迎吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0163_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "28524b1205b6dfc5cd70c85ba1f03444711df831fba3e8444873f3cebfbe99f6", "ja": "うーん。人気者かどうかはわからないですけど、\nクラスのみんなとは仲良くしてますよ？", "zh": "嗯……我也不知道自己算不算受欢迎，不过和班里的同学相处得都很好哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0163_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8503068649979f5a5e7ea95e3b38b355f2cf44e955a0b67036161d47ce69d6a7", "ja": "でもやっぱり、女の子の友達と一緒にいることが\n多いかも？　男の子とは、洋服の話とかできないし。", "zh": "不过果然还是，和女生朋友待在一起的时候比较多吧？毕竟和男生没什么服装方面的话题可聊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0163_1009_p", "source_sha256": "7f20b0929ed53c9b11549b2366d9179e792adea1f41bc1ef12f24c6605a70a5e", "ja": "そうか……中学生にもなると、\n女子と男子で話題が違うかもしれないな。", "zh": "这样啊……上了初中以后，女生和男生聊的话题可能就不一样了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0163_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "226b182a372866db3651808f67bbef6843eae1698a9055404074b925e6b7eb99", "ja": "えへへ。{$P$}さんと\n学校のこと話すのって、なんか楽しいですね♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，和{$P$}先生聊学校里的事，感觉还挺开心的呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0163_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8272a4fd5abed11008676a1833c26927cb8d5391a347799544878cd68025e91e", "ja": "ちょっとだけ、クラスメイトになった気分かも！", "zh": "感觉好像只当了一小会儿同班同学呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0163_1012_p", "source_sha256": "61974cbe7319c5f3298a32ea390508d28b57d0f5af957a2d727eddc5be5adffa", "ja": "クラスメイト？\n年齢的には、先生だと思うんだけど……。", "zh": "同班同学？\n按年龄来说，我觉得应该是老师才对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0163_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1284b074491f0930bce0272acf594423d091d6e9175d7d6915efdeb4f0016dca", "ja": "む～。先生と生徒じゃ、\n放課後にデートとかできないじゃないですか～！", "zh": "唔～。老师和学生的话，不就没法放学后约会了吗～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0163_1014_016tsu", "source_sha256": "84de71dafac2624dd8f31e38cb8ae68b0de733af9c3ecc911cb1e8e46064167b", "ja": "わたしは、{$P$}さんと\nいっぱい話したいんだから♪", "zh": "我可是想和{$P$}先生聊好多好多话呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0163_1015_p", "source_sha256": "a39a59073901a11756473ed9f7eca73c31108fe63c53c831f987001d55954264", "ja": "確かに、先生と生徒でデートはできないな……。", "zh": "确实，老师和学生是没办法约会的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0163_1016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3db4b5ec2942c2c9793db78ee8229d2021cd6e62aeee39ca76d2c51a0826247f", "ja": "そうそう、やっぱりクラスメイトですよね！　だから\n今日も、撮影が終わったら、一緒に帰りましょうね♪", "zh": "对对，果然还是同学嘛！所以  \n今天拍摄结束后，我们一起回去吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0163_1017_016tsu", "source_sha256": "09d26dd052397641c8e6551644eb812c4fd896ff3d3068c94dabc03166901629", "ja": "わたし、今日はショッピングに行きたいな～。\nアイスも食べたいし……あ、カラオケもしたいですね！", "zh": "我今天想去逛街呢～。\n还想吃冰淇淋……啊，也想去唱卡拉OK！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0163_1018_staff", "source_sha256": "1e33aa5199326882f81aa105a935c5ac7ac0c9ffd9436516d6a4d67d350176d0", "ja": "伊吹さん、スタンバイお願いしまーす！", "zh": "伊吹小姐，请准备上场！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0163_1019_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7c9a824c7afdd116e37faac265ace2aa1c07d83800a88182048fb37353f8fe7e", "ja": "あっ、は～い！　{$P$}さん、\nそろそろ撮影が始まるみたいなので、行ってきますね！", "zh": "啊，好——！{$P$}先生，好像马上就要开始拍摄了，我先过去啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0163_1020_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f9bb11d6b7ee448056e354eeb6ee03f561eec2ab10b9383f5c6c586c5cecb2a2", "ja": "今日の放課後デート、楽しみにしてますね！\nえへへ♪", "zh": "我很期待今天放学后的约会哦！\n嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0163_1021_p", "source_sha256": "b7ba01d5b897b800c09ba2175d6080756f9e838ccd75c3ee42baa0c5ea363184", "ja": "（結局、帰りは翼の買い物に付き合わされて、アイスを\nご馳走する事になった。何というか、流石だな……！）", "zh": "（结果，回去的时候被翼拉着陪她买东西，还得请她吃冰淇淋。该说不愧是她吗……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
